4","article-title":"Non-Canonical G-quadruplexes cause the hCEB1 minisatellite instability in Saccharomyces cerevisiae","volume":"6","author":"Piazza","year":"2017","journal-title":"Elife"},{"key":"ref_83","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"283","DOI":"10.2217\/pgs.11.153","article-title":"6-mercaptopurine influences TPMT gene transcription in a TPMT gene promoter variable number of tandem repeats-dependent manner","volume":"13","author":"Kotur","year":"2012","journal-title":"Pharmacogenomics"},{"key":"ref_84","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"534","DOI":"10.1006\/jmbi.1996.0659","article-title":"Structure\u2013function correlations of the insulin-linked polymorphic region","volume":"264","author":"Catasti","year":"1996","journal-title":"J. Mol. Biol."},{"key":"ref_85","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"691","DOI":"10.1089\/dna.2011.1248","article-title":"Analysis of Promoter Methylation and Polymorphic Minisatellites of BORIS and Lack of Association with Gastric Cancer","volume":"30","author":"Yoon","year":"2011","journal-title":"DNA Cell Biol."},{"key":"ref_86","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"11","DOI":"10.1006\/geno.1996.0317","article-title":"Isolation and characterization of the human cardiac troponin I gene (TNNI3)","volume":"35","author":"Bhavsar","year":"1996","journal-title":"Genomics"},{"key":"ref_87","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"8038","DOI":"10.1093\/nar\/gky735","article-title":"i-Motif DNA: Structural features and significance to cell biology","volume":"46","author":"Damha","year":"2018","journal-title":"Nucleic Acids Res."},{"key":"ref_88","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"2951","DOI":"10.1093\/nar\/gkx090","article-title":"Identification of multiple genomic DNA sequences which form i-motif structures at neutral pH","volume":"45","author":"Wright","year":"2017","journal-title":"Nucleic Acids Res."},{"key":"ref_89","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"2600","DOI":"10.21037\/jgo-21-705","ar